WEBVTT

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.360
Full Moon

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:07.700
Time of the Ceremony

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:15.460
Though the time has come, we are still missing one of the shrine maidens necessary for the ceremony.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:19.250
We don't have a choice anymore.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.380
The time hath reached its zenith and God's land approaches.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.090
Muneakira!

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.210
Jyuubei!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:26.210
Welcome back!

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:28.720
I was able to awaken thanks to your voices.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.550
Thank you, Yukimura, Senhime-sama.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:39.350
I don't want to interrupt this touching moment, so I'll go ahead and leave you now.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.440
Yoshihiko-sama, please wait!

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.270
Gisen will act soon.

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:48.400
Shouldn't we cooperate to face Amakusa?

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:53.070
A marvelous proposition, Yagyuu Muneakira-kun.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:57.870
But I no longer have the need to ask for your help.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:02.330
I've already extracted the samurai genome out of Jyuubei there.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:03.670
Samurai Genome

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.550
Naturals are indeed the best.

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:09.880
I was able to get better data than I expected.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:15.350
Thanks to you, the stalled Izanami Project has become something more viable!

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.260
Izanami Project

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:21.480
The samurai genome has already been distributed throughout the network.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:27.360
Soon, these mass-produced master samurai will be rolled out from the Ooedo lab.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:33.280
The ultimate maidens, deployed to anywhere in the country within an hour!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.620
I have my pieces lined up.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:38.490
Friends?

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.710
I don't need them!

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.670
So that's that.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:49.710
That piece of trash will get scrapped as well!

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:53.760
Hey, can you hear me? I don't need you.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.050
Onii-sama!

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:56.890
And you still call yourself a general?

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:58.430
A foolish question!

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:01.810
Tokugawa Yoshihiko is not a general, he is a commander!

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:06.480
You just have to shut up and do as I say.

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:08.610
Jyuubei?

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.150
Whoa there.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:14.660
Harming me would only mess up the army's chain of command.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.080
My my, are you insane?

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.950
Stop it, Jyuubei!

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.250
You're the one who said you'd cooperate.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.080
Stop it, Jyuubei.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.800
If we fight, it'll only help Gisen!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:33.550
I'm not so <i>stupid</i> as to fight the ultimate master samurai.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.130
See you.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.680
You coward!

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.430
But...

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:38.850
What's there to ponder?

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.310
I'll slice him.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:41.140
Don't, Jyuubei!

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:42.770
Stop it!

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:47.150
Don't worry, Muneakira.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.520
I'll protect you to the end.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.740
Yoshihiko-sama, please run!

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:53.490
What?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.450
You don't care what happens to Great Japan?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.120
Great Japan?

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:00.660
Like I care.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:06.540
I have to thank you for screwing around with my general's body.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:07.880
Damn you...!

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.500
Jyuubei, don't.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.000
Stop it!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:21.720
You're just a samurai.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:24.730
Do you realize who you just defied?!

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:29.400
You're not a general. You're a commander.

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:33.030
If you dare disgrace my general,

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:36.240
I don't care if you're a commander.

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.320
You're dead!

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.080
Mode change:

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:42.410
Tonnerre!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.080
Muneakira!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.160
Are you all right?

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:47.670
Yeah.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.960
We have to stop Jyuubei though.

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:58.760
Looks like my spiritual binding was still in effect.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.060
She's fast.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.470
Mode change:

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:05.810
Flamme!

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:13.610
She's not just fast?

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:21.740
Vent!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:22.120
What?

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.040
Jyuubei!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.040
Stop it already, Jyuubei.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.550
We shouldn't be fighting each other!

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.340
What's wrong, Natural?

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.680
Looks like Nia's pressing you.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.180
Make her stop.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.680
If she fights anymore, your samurai will die.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.600
True. But that's not a problem.

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:52.560
I already have plenty of replacements.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:54.320
Go, Nia.

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:57.780
If you're my samurai, fight valiantly to the end!

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:01.030
Onii-sama, how could you!

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.490
How rotten of a man are you?

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:05.910
She's crying.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.250
A samurai is crying.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.130
I see.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.090
Yes.

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:16.250
She was the same as us.

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.510
Since he's her general...

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:20.680
Though he's such a foolish general...

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:22.840
She loves him with all her heart.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.890
What's wrong, Nia?

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:28.180
You're not so weak as to become immobile from that little heat.

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:36.610
Now that we have a mass-producible model, all you can do is leave behind a little more battle data.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:39.360
Hurry up and move, Nia!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:44.320
Sheesh, did the spiritual binding fail again?

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.450
How useless.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.790
Will you move already, you piece of junk!

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:51.370
Don't you understand, Yoshihiko-sama?!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:56.340
Your samurai isn't under spiritual binding!

00:07:56.840 --> 00:08:00.420
She stood up by her own will to protect her general!

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:03.510
And yet you do this, Onii-sama.

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:08.560
One who cannot understand his samurai's feelings has no right to lead master samurai!

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:09.970
What an annoying bunch.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:14.730
That kind of talk is why the number of master samurai continues to decrease!

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.230
Nia, this is my last order.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.980
If you don't follow it, you-

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:26.280
I didn't think you were still hanging on to <i>that</i> relationship.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.200
Three Years Ago

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.540
Bonjour.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:40.340
Let me introduce myself.

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:40.710
I'm-

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:43.550
Student Council President, Tokugawa Yoshihiko-dono.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:45.180
Correct.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:49.970
I heard that a foreign exchange student from France has arrived, and a beautiful one too-

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:51.390
What is your objective in approaching me?

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:55.480
My objective, eh?

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:57.690
A crane?

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:06.240
I-I'm kind of clumsy.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:07.950
I see.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:12.240
It's the book's fault.

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.410
Hand it to me, I'll make one.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.290
It's "bonsoir".

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.010
That's what you say once the sun's setting.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:30.810
I could have kidnapped her and obtained her genetic data, like I did with the other students.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:38.810
But she was able to see right through my act.

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:47.070
And she was the first girl to ignore my position as student council president.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.700
Making her fall for me was very entertaining.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:55.200
Yes, it was but a game.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:03.500
Of course in the end, I won.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:12.810
All right. Inject the samurai genome.

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:17.100
Y-Yoshihiko... Why?

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.440
Nia.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:23.070
You are the first subject to clear every physical exam.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.400
How ironic.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:32.870
I didn't think the first artificial master samurai would be born from a French girl.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:35.830
Nia.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.080
Lend me your power for me...

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:41.330
No, for Great Japan.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.500
Yoshihiko, please. Stop.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.090
No.

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:47.720
No!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:53.890
Even after all that, she still loves me.

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:55.310
Nia.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.850
Fight the master samurai down there.

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:01.100
Onii-sama, you still don't understand?

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:03.230
Poor samurai.

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:06.530
As a warrior, the only pity I can give you is to slice you together with your master.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:09.990
Stop it, Jyuubei! There's no justice being served in this battle!

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:10.950
Think harder.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.780
Even if I sheathed my blades,

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:17.450
this battle won't end as long as that general stands.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.410
Precisely!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.710
This battle is necessary.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.800
Let's see whose sense of justice is correct, once and for all.

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:28.590
Go, Nia!

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:30.300
If that love of yours is truly love!

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:38.180
Shadow Blink!

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:38.770
Shadow Blink
Shadow Blink!

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:39.560
Shadow Blink

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.060
Ice Fang!

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:44.770
No!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:47.320
Stop it!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.650
If anyone should stand in the way,

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:54.370
whether it be the Buddha or the Devil...

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.120
I'll slice it!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.530
What's wrong, Nia?!

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.950
Is that the power of your love?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.330
Both of you, stop it!

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.830
Muneakira, stop them!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.670
This fight is necessary?

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.010
If the road of the heavens exists in this world...

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:17.810
there's no way this insanity would be allowed!

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:20.310
Human feelings...

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:21.980
Something precious like that...

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.440
There's no way they should be crushed like this!

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:35.700
General

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.370
Did he...?

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.040
What happened?

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:49.170
Muneakira?

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.680
This fight ends here.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:08.610
Please stop, Yoshihiko-sama.

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:10.020
Don't jerk me around!

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:12.360
Who do you think you are?!

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:23.790
Yoshihiko-sama, you cannot possibly be such a person.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:28.460
Of all the things you could have said...

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.340
What can you possibly know about me?!

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.420
Look beside you.

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:36.470
You have such a great samurai on your side.

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:43.140
Is that not proof that you are a great general?

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:46.890
A great general?

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:48.190
Pointless.

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:51.110
There's no meaning behind that!

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:57.990
You commoners cannot understand the pressure one's feeling when trying to maintain the peace of Great Japan

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:00.370
and its people on his own.

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:06.960
Idealists like you put us in this critical situation in the first place!

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:26.430
What's with this massive increase in spiritual energy?

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:27.520
This is...?

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:28.230
It can't be.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:29.400
She made her move?

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:30.310
Gisen.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.620
Yukimura, Senhime-sama, go that way!

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:44.160
All right, meet up at the shelter.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.330
Ridiculous!

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:50.500
This facility is designed to withstand level ten spiritual impacts.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:58.590
Yagyuu Gisen... Where is she getting all this energy from?

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:09.480
This shaking... Ohii-sama!

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:12.730
What's with this earthquake?!

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:15.860
Yukimura-sama, please be safe.

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.580
Love?

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:31.620
Friends?

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.540
Those things are just a bother.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.880
Nobody ordered you to save me!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:42.550
This is...

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:49.640
All right.

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:51.190
That's not a crane.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:52.810
Don't say that.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.940
Not everyone in Japan is a master of origami-

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:56.650
What is that?

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:58.730
It's a warrior's helmet.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:15:59.440
A warrior's helmet...

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:04.160
It's a piece of armor that samurai of Great Japan wear to protect their masters.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.200
I'll take good care of it.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.290
You're so stupid, Nia.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:16.380
I gave you mountains of better things as presents.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.800
Then why did you keep this the whole time...?

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:21.970
Why...

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:23.050
Why...

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:24.680
Why...?!

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:28.260
Why am I crying?

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:31.140
I'm a great general?

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:33.480
There's no way that could be.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:34.770
No way at all.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:36.360
I'm sorry.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:40.440
You were so lonely carrying Great Japan on your back...

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.110
I couldn't take that load off of your shoulders.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:54.330
Ow...

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.790
Onii-chan!

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:05.840
Amakusa Shirou

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:08.930
Returns

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.850
Amakusa Shirou's samurai,

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:14.640
Yagyuu Gisen states here:

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:18.110
The time hath reached its peak and God's land approaches.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:21.860
Thou shalt reform thyselves and believe in the Gospel!

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.030
I repeat.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:26.990
The time hath reached its peak and God's land approaches.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:30.410
Thou shalt reform thyselves and believe in the Gospel!

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:38.790
We detect an irregular increase in spiritual energy.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:44.210
Yagyuu Gisen and Amakusa Shirou are assumed to be inside.

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:47.470
All master samurai, activate.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:09.740
One hour later

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:13.080
Underground shelter

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:16.040
Hey, is it still not fixed?

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:17.960
Almost there...

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:18.830
We have an image.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:20.830
This is...

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.670
And they call themselves master samurai?

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:29.010
What failures.

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:31.600
Since their general, Yoshihiko-sama, isn't around,

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.720
their power must be dwindling.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:39.520
Our only hope is the special forces that are under direct control of Tokugawa Yoshihiko.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:43.190
But they lost their commander as well, so we don't know how long they can hold out.

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:49.570
This isn't good! The enemy noticed our presence!

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:52.410
What should we do?

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:54.830
We have to fight.

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:59.040
Even if we close all the walls,

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.540
we probably only have 40 minutes at the most.

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:05.840
Ohii-sama!

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:07.090
Yukimura-sama.

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.050
Where is Jyuubei-san's group?

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:10.930
They don't seem to be within the shelter.

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:14.810
There are students in the shelter!

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:21.140
They <i>are</i> samurai, more or less, so couldn't we have them help us out?

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.480
If we could, we would've done that ages ago.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:26.440
What a useless idea.

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:29.490
What do you mean, "useless"?!

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:34.070
Then do <i>you</i> have some kind of marvelous plot?

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:35.080
Yukimura?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:35.490
Yes.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.250
Let's try it once more.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.500
Waveform Clairvoyance
Indeed.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.250
Waveform Clairvoyance

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:42.500
Yagyuu

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:44.580
Jyuubei, awaken.
Yagyuu

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:45.920
Jyuubei.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:47.750
Yagyuu Jyuubei

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:48.670
Jyuubei-san.

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:51.260
Muneakira broke the chains.

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:53.390
Yes, I know.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:57.560
He's finally awakened completely as a general.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:03.060
The next kiss will make the true contract between Muneakira and me.

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:04.860
The true contract...

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.020
Yes.

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:11.530
It will be the kiss that completely revives me, Yagyuu Jyuubei.

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:12.320
Yagyuu Jyuubei

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:17.330
That also means that the imperfect me,

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.500
born from the imperfect contract, will disappear.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:20.950
Yagyuu Jyuubei
Yagyuu

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.910
The imperfect me...
Yagyuu Jyuubei
Yagyuu

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:30.840
The next time I kiss Muneakira, your personality will probably cease to exist within me.

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:32.260
Cease...

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:40.100
Jyuubei.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:44.440
Onii-chan.

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:46.860
Thank goodness.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:48.190
Where is this...?

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.860
Ghosts!

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.110
Namuamidabutsu,

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.070
namuamidabutsu...

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.620
Fool! We aren't dead.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:21:01.790
More like you two would've been dead if we didn't wake you up.

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:09.750
The life of the shelter is a small flame in the face of a gust of wind.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:11.550
We don't have a moment to waste.

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:12.800
You'll have to escape right away.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.170
Jyuubei.

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:15.800
I need your strength.

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:16.720
Yagyuu Jyuubei
Jyuubei

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:18.800
Let's kiss.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:19.720
Yagyuu Jyuubei

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:23.480
<i>The next kiss will make the true contract...</i>

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:24.390
True contract

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:28.400
<i>And your personality will probably cease to exist.</i>

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:33.150
Cease

00:23:12.170 --> 00:23:14.750
It all started with a girl falling from the sky.

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.550
And then, my kisses turned those girls into master samurai.

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:22.760
What is the bond between a general and samurai?

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:25.470
And the shadow that covers Great Japan?

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:28.390
I still can't quite articulate it.

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:31.350
But there's one thing I figured out:

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:33.650
it's what I must do now.

00:23:33.650 --> 00:23:35.360
Let's go, everyone.

00:23:35.360 --> 00:23:36.110
It's showdown time.

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:37.230
Onii-chan!

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:40.530
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran: The Goodbye Kiss.
